    },
    {
      "senseId": "w:measure#s2",
      "pos": "v.",
      "glossZh": "衡量；评估",
      "pronunciationId": "w:measure#p-main",
      "origin": "gaokao",
      "counts": {
        "gaokao": 6,
        "mock": 0
      },
      "folded": false,
      "examples": [
        {
          "exampleId": "w:measure#e-962c4ef2a6447226",
          "text": "Many people now misunderstand emotional intelligence as almost everything desirable in a person’s makeup that cannot be measured by an IQ test, such as character, motivation, confidence, mental stability, optimism and “people skills.” Research has shown that emotional skills may contribute to some of these qualities, but most of them move far beyond skill-based emotional intelligence.",
          "source": {
            "paperId": "paper-gaokao-2021-i",
            "paperTitle": "2021年普通高等学校招生全国统一考试英语",
            "groupId": "group:paper-gaokao-2021-i:reading-d",
            "locator": {
              "paragraph": 1,
              "paragraphId": "block:paper-gaokao-2021-i:reading-d:1",
              "sentence": 2
            }
          },
          "tier": "gaokao",
          "target": {
            "start": 120,
            "end": 128
          }
        },
        {
          "exampleId": "w:measure#e-3e0540b17c7993a3",
          "text": "I decided that I wanted to learn as many words as I could and started marking every entry I looked up with a pencil to measure my progress.",
          "source": {
            "paperId": "paper-gaokao-2026-i",
            "paperTitle": "2026年普通高等学校招生全国统一考试（全国I卷）英语学科试题卷",
            "groupId": "group:paper-gaokao-2026-i:reading-b",
            "locator": {
              "paragraph": 3,
              "paragraphId": "block:paper-gaokao-2026-i:reading-b:3",
              "sentence": 2
            }
          },
          "tier": "gaokao",
          "target": {
            "start": 119,
            "end": 126
          }
        },
        {
          "exampleId": "w:measure#e-e475f7f8004a0070",
          "text": "Emotional states of participants were also measured by asking about their feelings while completing the gallery task.",
          "source": {
            "paperId": "paper-gaokao-2026-i",
            "paperTitle": "2026年普通高等学校招生全国统一考试（全国I卷）英语学科试题卷",
            "groupId": "group:paper-gaokao-2026-i:reading-d",
            "locator": {
              "paragraph": 4,
              "paragraphId": "block:paper-gaokao-2026-i:reading-d:4",
              "sentence": 1
            }
          },
          "tier": "gaokao",
          "target": {
            "start": 43,
            "end": 51
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "senseId": "w:measure#s3",
      "pos": "n.",
      "glossZh": "衡量标准；衡量指标",
      "pronunciationId": "w:measure#p-main",
