      "folded": false,
      "examples": [
        {
          "exampleId": "w:measure#e-5dcdbe3534b4e669",
          "text": "Conservation measures will have to be put in place if these deep-sea fish are to survive.",
          "source": {
            "paperId": "paper-gaokao-2023-four-provinces-feb",
            "paperTitle": "2023年2月四省联考英语",
            "groupId": "group:paper-gaokao-2023-four-provinces-feb:seven-choices",
            "locator": {
              "paragraph": 2,
              "paragraphId": "block:paper-gaokao-2023-four-provinces-feb:seven-choices:2",
              "sentence": 1
            }
          },
          "tier": "gaokao",
          "target": {
            "start": 13,
            "end": 21
          }
        },
        {
          "exampleId": "w:measure#e-e2cf6653782422d9",
          "text": "The government has struggled to come up with measures to address the problem, particularly in the poorer, rural areas east of the Volga River, including arranging doctor’s appointments by video chat and expanding financial aid programs to motivate doctors to practice medicine in remote parts of the country like Krasnoyarsk.",
          "source": {
            "paperId": "paper-gaokao-2024-national-a",
            "paperTitle": "2024 年普通高等学校招生全国统一考试英语（全国甲卷）",
            "groupId": "group:paper-gaokao-2024-national-a:reading-c",
            "locator": {
              "paragraph": 3,
              "paragraphId": "block:paper-gaokao-2024-national-a:reading-c:3",
              "sentence": 2
            }
          },
          "tier": "gaokao",
          "target": {
            "start": 45,
            "end": 53
          }
        },
        {
          "exampleId": "w:measure#e-fbef8712561726c5",
          "text": "Now, new research suggests that a simple, cheap measure may significantly reduce the level of microplastics in water from your tap（水龙头）: boiling and filtering（过滤）it.",
          "source": {
            "paperId": "paper-gaokao-2025-i",
            "paperTitle": "2025年普通高等学校招生全国统一考试（新课标Ⅰ）英语试题",
